              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shisheeyaha idinla degganu waa inuu idiinla mid ahaadaa sida waddaniga idin dhex jooga, oo waa inaad isaga u jeclaataan sidaad naftiinna u jeceshihiin oo kale, maxaa yeelay, idinkuba shisheeyayaal baad ku ahaan jirteen dalkii Masar, waayo, aniga ayaa ah Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.34"
            ]
          }
